  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Slice zucchini and capsicum into thin sticks.\n• Trim green beans and baby broccoli.\n• Finely chop garlic.\n• In a small bowl, a a good drizzle of olive oil, garlic and chilli flakes (if using), then season with pepper.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67e38824f8f6928425d5c61b/step-8edb9000.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Cut plain tofu (see ingredients) into 2cm chunks.\n• In a large frying pan, heat a generous drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• When the oil is hot, cook tofu, turning occasionally, 4-5 minutes.\n• Add garlic and chilli oil to cook, turning to coat, until fragrant, 1 minute.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67e38824f8f6928425d5c61b/step-630b8210.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Wipe out frying pan, then return to high heat with a drizzle of olive oil.\n• Stir-fry capsicum, green beans, zucchini and baby broccoli until tender, 4-5 minutes.\n• Add ginger paste and cook until fragrant, 1 minute. Add the soy sauce and honey and cook until bubbling, 30 seconds. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67e38824f8f6928425d5c61b/step-6b62a120.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide tofu and ginger-soy veggies between plates.\n• Spoon over any resting juices. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67e38824f8f6928425d5c61b/step-1892e730.jpg"
    }
  ]
